{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Um... 
{PAUSE ""}
Apparently she's almost here..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's fine. You're the last one today, </STYLE>Niimura-san<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Sorry... <STYLE ID="2">My mom</STYLE> said this was the only time she could make it..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Say, </STYLE>Niimura-san<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Niimura-san<STYLE ID="1">, you moved to Motoki-cho three years ago, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh? Yes... Is something wrong?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, it's nothing..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sliding_wooden_door_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm sorry! I'm late! Haah... haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah, you must be </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-san's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Haah... haah... I'm sorry, Sensei. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Sorry, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2">, for being late."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, it's fine."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ma'am</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, shall we go to the reception room instead of the classroom? I think it would be more relaxing there."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Haah... haah... No, I have to get back to work right away."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"O-oh, I see. Then we'd better hurry."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes, please."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Um... </STYLE>Haruka-san<STYLE ID="1"> has lots of friends, works well with others, and fits in nicely with everyone. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Academically, she seems strong in the humanities, but her science and math could use a little more work. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Also―"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um, Sensei..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Is </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> really not having any trouble at school?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? Yes, she's fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Really?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Come on, <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE>..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Um, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">ma'am</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE>Haruka-san<STYLE ID="1"> is a bright, kind student, as you can see, and her classmates really look up to her. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You can rest easy on that point."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"A-ahahaha, I got bullied a bit at my old school, so <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE>'s a little sensitive about it..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Haruka-san<STYLE ID="1"> was?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Sensei, bullying is something that happens where teachers don't see it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">And the person being bullied can hardly ever bring themselves to talk to anyone about it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE>, stop it..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"People can get bullied even when they've done nothing wrong!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hey, come on..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Um, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">ma'am</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I hear she used to go to school in Megasawa City?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　As you know, everyone in Motoki-cho is very kind-hearted. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> dotes on me too much... She's a worrier."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Say, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2">, are you really all right? If you're going to say something, now's the best chance.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Look, that's what this parent-teacher meeting is for."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE>, don't worry. I have fun at school every day."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But if anything's ever wrong, tell me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Mom will help you, no matter what happens. Always."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Okay..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"―Well then, please take good care of my </STYLE>daughter<STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE>, be careful."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Thank you for coming."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sliding_wooden_door_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\夜の教室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Phew..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Sorry, Tanizaki-sensei. <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE>'s a worrier..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Was it okay not to go home with your </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE>'s going straight back to work..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, that's right... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But... just a little..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hm?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"She smelled a little of alcohol..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> does that kind of work too..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> works day and night, any job she can get, to raise me, and she does the housework too..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So that's how it is..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I keep telling her I'll at least handle the house stuff, but <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE>'s kind of an all-or-nothing person..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Say, </STYLE>Niimura-san<STYLE ID="1">, I'm just asking to be sure, but you're not being bullied, are you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh? Oh, nothing like that at all at this school. It's a really fun school."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, as long as you're okay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> doesn't really trust schools or teachers anymore, because of our time in Megasawa... 
{PAUSE ""}
So please don't think badly of her. She just dotes on me, that's all."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Niimura-san<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Take good care of your </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. I'll help as much as I can too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes, of course. Thank you."
